Subject: Cantor SJS Compiled Minimum Recoverable Frame P0 Data Design

& [PrimaryForms]
  + Request owns JustificationScope ScopeWideHintCovenant OperativeFrame RecoverySources InitialBasis CandidatePolicy input class evidence references nonauthority and digest
  + Hint owns class retention release source and recovery coordinates; RecoverySource owns one exact supplied frame
  + Envelope owns initial and final bases ordered RestorationWitness values NarrativeProjection disposition and digest
  + Verification and EvidenceManifest own independently recomputed counts identities byte hashes and zero-effect accounts

& [Normalization]
  + declared sets sort and deduplicate; sequences preserve governed order; ordinary strings are bounded trimmed control-free; UUIDs are lowercase nonnil; hashes are uppercase hex

& [Comparison]
  + canonical OperativeFrame bytes are the P0 equality oracle; zero sources or multiple distinct frames are underdetermined and one unequal frame is drifted

& [Accounting]
  + attempts equal admitted plus drift refusals plus underdetermined refusals; narrative events equal witnesses; basis count and serialized bytes strictly decrease on each admission
